{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"06.03","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":77,"reply_count":25,"alternative_count":8,"total_audio_count":110,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"06.03.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我已经叫车了。","meaning_my":"ကား ခေါ်ထားပြီးပြီ။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"上车点在哪儿？","meaning_my":"ကားတက်ရမယ့်နေရာ ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"到前面的指定上车点等我吧。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့က သတ်မှတ်ထားတဲ့ ကားတက်နေရာမှာ စောင့်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"在哪里上车？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်မှာ ကားတက်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"司机到哪儿了？","meaning_my":"ယာဉ်မောင်း ဘယ်ရောက်နေပြီလဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"还有三分钟左右到。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် သုံးမိနစ်လောက်နေရင် ရောက်မယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"司机还有几分钟到？","meaning_my":"ယာဉ်မောင်း ရောက်ဖို့ နောက်ထပ် ဘယ်နှမိနစ်လိုသေးလဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"定位对吗？","meaning_my":"တည်နေရာ မှန်ရဲ့လား။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"定位有点偏，我重新发一下。","meaning_my":"တည်နေရာ နည်းနည်းလွဲနေလို့ ပြန်ပို့ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"怎么联系司机？","meaning_my":"ယာဉ်မောင်းကို ဘယ်လို ဆက်သွယ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"我找不到你的车。","meaning_my":"ကားကို ရှာမတွေ့ဘူး။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我在东门，你看到白色的车了吗？","meaning_my":"အရှေ့ဝင်ပေါက်မှာပါ၊ အဖြူရောင်ကား မြင်လား။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"车牌尾号是多少？","meaning_my":"ကားနံပါတ်ပြားရဲ့ နောက်ဆုံးဂဏန်းတွေက ဘာတွေလဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S009_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"车牌后四位是六七八九。","meaning_my":"ကားနံပါတ်ရဲ့ နောက်ဆုံးလေးလုံးက ခြောက်၊ ခုနစ်၊ ရှစ်၊ ကိုး။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S009_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S009_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"车牌后四位是多少？","meaning_my":"ကားနံပါတ်ရဲ့ နောက်ဆုံးလေးလုံးက ဘာတွေလဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S009_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"我在东门等你。","meaning_my":"အရှေ့ဝင်ပေါက်မှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"我在东门，不是西门。","meaning_my":"အရှေ့ဝင်ပေါက်မှာပါ၊ အနောက်ဝင်ပေါက် မဟုတ်ဘူး။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"我在路口等你。","meaning_my":"လမ်းဆုံမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"我在公交站旁边等你。","meaning_my":"ဘတ်စ်ကားမှတ်တိုင်ဘေးမှာ စောင့်နေမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S014","kind":"main","cn":"我在马路对面。","meaning_my":"လမ်းတစ်ဖက်ကမ်းမှာ ရှိနေတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S015","kind":"main","cn":"我站在便利店门口。","meaning_my":"ကုန်စုံဆိုင် တံခါးဝမှာ ရပ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S016","kind":"main","cn":"我穿黑色外套。","meaning_my":"အနက်ရောင် အပေါ်အင်္ကျီ ဝတ်ထားတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S017","kind":"main","cn":"你能开到门口吗？","meaning_my":"တံခါးဝအထိ မောင်းလာပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S017_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不好意思，得去指定上车点。","meaning_my":"အားနာပါတယ်၊ သတ်မှတ်ထားတဲ့ ကားတက်နေရာကို လာပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S017_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S018","kind":"main","cn":"能停到路边吗？","meaning_my":"လမ်းဘေးမှာ ရပ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S018_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"这里不能停车。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာမှာ ကားရပ်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S018_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S019","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦打一下双闪，我好找车。","meaning_my":"ကားအရေးပေါ်မီးနှစ်ဖက် ဖွင့်ပေးပါဦး၊ ကားကို ရှာလို့လွယ်အောင်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S020","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦往前开一点。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့ကို နည်းနည်း မောင်းလာပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S021","kind":"main","cn":"我马上到上车点。","meaning_my":"ကားတက်တဲ့နေရာ ရောက်တော့မယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S022","kind":"main","cn":"你等我两分钟。","meaning_my":"နှစ်မိနစ်လောက် စောင့်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S023","kind":"main","cn":"司机取消订单了，怎么办？","meaning_my":"ယာဉ်မောင်းက အော်ဒါ ဖျက်လိုက်ပြီ၊ ဘယ်လိုလုပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S023_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以重新叫一辆车。","meaning_my":"ကားတစ်စီး ထပ်ခေါ်လို့ရတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S023_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.01-S024","kind":"main","cn":"取消订单要收费吗？","meaning_my":"အော်ဒါဖျက်ရင် အခကြေးငွေ ပေးရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.01-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S001","kind":"main","cn":"师傅，您接的是我这单吗？","meaning_my":"ဆရာ၊ ဒီအော်ဒါကို လက်ခံထားတာလား။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，请先核对一下车牌号。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ ကားနံပါတ်ကို အရင် တိုက်စစ်ကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这是我叫的车吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါ ခေါ်ထားတဲ့ကားလား။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S002","kind":"main","cn":"车牌号对吗？","meaning_my":"ကားနံပါတ် မှန်ရဲ့လား။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，车牌号一致。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ ကားနံပါတ် ကိုက်ညီတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S003","kind":"main","cn":"是这辆白色的车吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီအဖြူရောင်ကားလား။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S004","kind":"main","cn":"师傅，是去火车站吗？","meaning_my":"ဆရာ၊ ရထားဘူတာကြီးကို သွားမယ့်ကားလား။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，火车站哪个入口下车？","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ ရထားဘူတာရဲ့ ဘယ်ဝင်ပေါက်မှာ ဆင်းမလဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S005","kind":"main","cn":"目的地没错吧？","meaning_my":"သွားမယ့်နေရာ မှန်တယ်နော်။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S006","kind":"main","cn":"请确认手机尾号。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းနံပါတ်ရဲ့ နောက်ဆုံးဂဏန်းတွေ ပြောပြပေးပါ။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S006_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"手机尾号是一二三四。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းနံပါတ်ရဲ့ နောက်ဆုံးလေးလုံးက တစ်၊ နှစ်၊ သုံး၊ လေးပါ။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S006_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S007","kind":"main","cn":"后备箱能放行李吗？","meaning_my":"ကားနောက်ဖုံးထဲ ခရီးဆောင်အိတ် ထည့်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S008","kind":"main","cn":"能打开一下后备箱吗？","meaning_my":"ကားနောက်ဖုံးလေး ဖွင့်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S009","kind":"main","cn":"我坐后面。","meaning_my":"နောက်ခုံမှာ ထိုင်မယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S010","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦系安全带。","meaning_my":"ထိုင်ခုံခါးပတ် ပတ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，已经系好了。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ ပတ်ပြီးပါပြီ။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S011","kind":"main","cn":"能把窗户开一点吗？","meaning_my":"ကားပြတင်းပေါက် နည်းနည်း ဖွင့်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S012","kind":"main","cn":"空调能开小一点吗？","meaning_my":"အဲကွန်းလေ နည်းနည်း လျှော့ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S013","kind":"main","cn":"先等一下，还有人。","meaning_my":"ခဏစောင့်ပါဦး၊ နောက်တစ်ယောက် ရှိသေးတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S014","kind":"main","cn":"可以出发了。","meaning_my":"စထွက်လို့ရပြီ။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.02-S014_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"可以走了。","meaning_my":"ထွက်လို့ရပြီ။","audio_file":"06.03.02-S014_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S001","kind":"main","cn":"按导航走就行。","meaning_my":"မြေပုံလမ်းညွှန်အတိုင်း သွားလိုက်ရုံပဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S002","kind":"main","cn":"目的地就按定位走。","meaning_my":"သွားမယ့်နေရာကို တည်နေရာပြထားတဲ့အတိုင်း သွားပေးပါ။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S003","kind":"main","cn":"能走不堵车的路吗？","meaning_my":"ကားမပိတ်တဲ့လမ်းကနေ သွားပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，我看看哪条路更快。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ဘယ်လမ်းပိုမြန်လဲ ကြည့်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S004","kind":"main","cn":"前面堵吗？","meaning_my":"ရှေ့မှာ ကားပိတ်နေလား။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"这条路有点堵。","meaning_my":"ဒီလမ်းမှာ ကားနည်းနည်း ပိတ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S005","kind":"main","cn":"走这条路可以吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီလမ်းကနေ သွားလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，走哪条路都行。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ဘယ်လမ်းကသွားသွား ရပါတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S006","kind":"main","cn":"这条路会绕远吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီလမ်းက ပိုပတ်သွားရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S007","kind":"main","cn":"别绕太远。","meaning_my":"အဝေးကြီး ပတ်မမောင်းပါနဲ့။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S008","kind":"main","cn":"前面是不是封路了？","meaning_my":"ရှေ့မှာ လမ်းပိတ်ထားတာလား။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，我走另一条路。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ တခြားလမ်းကနေ သွားမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S009","kind":"main","cn":"导航建议走高速。","meaning_my":"မြေပုံလမ်းညွှန်က အမြန်လမ်းကနေ သွားဖို့ ပြနေတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S010","kind":"main","cn":"师傅，先不走高速。","meaning_my":"ဆရာ၊ အမြန်လမ်း မသွားပါနဲ့ဦး။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"高速费包含在车费里吗？","meaning_my":"အမြန်လမ်းကြေးက ကားခထဲ ပါပြီးသားလား။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S011_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"这段高速要收费，费用要另算。","meaning_my":"ဒီအမြန်လမ်းအပိုင်းမှာ ကြေးပေးရတယ်၊ သီးသန့်တွက်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S011_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"高速费我来付。","meaning_my":"အမြန်လမ်းကြေး ကိုယ်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S012_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"过路费我出。","meaning_my":"လမ်းကြေး ကိုယ်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S012_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"到东门就行。","meaning_my":"အရှေ့ဝင်ပေါက်အထိပဲ ပို့ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"东门进不去，我在附近停车。","meaning_my":"အရှေ့ဝင်ပေါက်က ဝင်လို့မရလို့ အနီးမှာ ရပ်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S013_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"在东门停就行。","meaning_my":"အရှေ့ဝင်ပေါက်မှာပဲ ရပ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S013_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"前面靠边停就行。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့မှာ လမ်းဘေးကပ်ပြီး ရပ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"前面能安全停车吗？","meaning_my":"ရှေ့မှာ ဘေးကင်းကင်း ကားရပ်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S015_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"前面不能停车，再往前一点吧。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့မှာ ကားရပ်လို့မရဘူး၊ နည်းနည်း ရှေ့ဆက်သွားရအောင်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S015_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"师傅，前面有地方掉头吗？","meaning_my":"ဆရာ၊ ရှေ့မှာ ကားပြန်လှည့်လို့ရတဲ့နေရာ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"我有点晕车，能开慢点吗？","meaning_my":"ကားနည်းနည်းမူးနေလို့ ဖြည်းဖြည်း မောင်းပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S017_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"有点晕车，麻烦开慢点。","meaning_my":"ကားနည်းနည်းမူးလို့ ဖြည်းဖြည်းမောင်းပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S017_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"我晕车了，能停一下吗？","meaning_my":"ကားမူးနေလို့ ခဏ ရပ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦开稳一点。","meaning_my":"ကားကို နည်းနည်း ညင်ညင်သာသာ မောင်းပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"我有点赶时间。","meaning_my":"အချိန် နည်းနည်း အလျင်လိုနေတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"我不赶时间，安全第一。","meaning_my":"အလျင်မလိုပါဘူး၊ ဘေးကင်းဖို့က အရေးကြီးဆုံးပါ။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"就是前面那个路口。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့က လမ်းဆုံနေရာပဲ။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S023","kind":"main","cn":"到了麻烦提醒我一下。","meaning_my":"ရောက်ရင် သတိပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.03-S023_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，到地方我提醒你。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ရောက်ရင် သတိပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.03-S023_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.04-S001","kind":"main","cn":"这里下就行。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာပဲ ဆင်းမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.04-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.04-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，我往前找个能停车的地方。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ ရှေ့မှာ ကားရပ်လို့ရတဲ့နေရာ ရှာပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.04-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.04-S002","kind":"main","cn":"师傅，能在前面的停车场停吗？","meaning_my":"ဆရာ၊ ရှေ့က ကားပါကင်မှာ ရပ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.04-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.04-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"前面禁停，我再往前一点停。","meaning_my":"ရှေ့မှာ ကားရပ်ခွင့်မရှိလို့ နည်းနည်း ရှေ့ဆက်ပြီးမှ ရပ်ပေးမယ်။","a