":"我的包忘在后座了。","meaning_my":"အိတ်ကို ကားနောက်ခုံမှာ မေ့ကျန်ခဲ့တယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.04-S011_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.04-S012","kind":"main","cn":"我手机落车上了。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းကို ကားထဲမှာ မေ့ကျန်ခဲ့တယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.04-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.04-S013","kind":"main","cn":"能联系司机吗？","meaning_my":"ယာဉ်မောင်းကို ဆက်သွယ်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"06.03.04-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.04-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我帮你联系司机。","meaning_my":"ယာဉ်မောင်းကို ဆက်သွယ်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.04-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.04-S014","kind":"main","cn":"司机说会送回来。","meaning_my":"ယာဉ်မောင်းက ပြန်လာပို့ပေးမယ်လို့ ပြောတယ်။","audio_file":"06.03.04-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.04-S015","kind":"main","cn":"东西找到了。","meaning_my":"ပစ္စည်း ရှာတွေ့ပြီ။","audio_file":"06.03.04-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"06.03.04-S016","kind":"main","cn":"请带好随身物品。","meaning_my":"ကိုယ့်ပစ္စည်းတွေ မမေ့ကျန်ခဲ့ပါစေနဲ့။","audio_file":"06.03.04-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
